{"abstain":true,"answer":"The provided material does not describe incremental class learning in YOLO or a method for adding 4 classes to an existing 7-class model while reducing training time and cloud costs.

Page 1 only provides general training guidance: start with 300 epochs, reduce the number if overfitting occurs early, and extend to 600, 1200, or more if overfitting does not occur after 300 epochs. This is not evidence of an efficient incremental-learning solution.

The YOLOv7 experiments on page 1 trained all models from scratch and did not use pretrained models, so they do not establish how to reuse your existing model to incorporate new classes efficiently.","citations":["第1页"]}
